<title>CHINA: China rice exports up 113.9 pct in Jan-April.</title>
<headline>China rice exports up 113.9 pct in Jan-April.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 160,000 tonnes of rice in the first four months of 1997, up 113.9 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>China exported 80,000 tonnes of rice in April alone, the figures showed. There was no year-ago figure for the month.</p>
<p>China imported 110,000 tonnes of rice in the first four months, down 56.0 percent, the figures showed.</p>
<p>It imported 10,000 tonnes in April alone.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
